A(t) = cos(t)**2/4 + 1/4 = 1/2 - sin(t)**2/4
B(t) = 3*sin(t)**2/4 - 1/2 = 3*sin(t)**2/4 - 1/2

X13: raw - decomp = 0
X14: raw - decomp = -(3*sin(t)**2 - 2)*cos(s/2)/4 + (cos(t)**2 + 1)*cos(3*s/2)/4 + sin(s/2)*sin(s)*sin(t)**2/2 - cos(s/2)*cos(s)*cos(t)**2
X23: raw - decomp = (3*sin(t)**2 - 2)*cos(s/2)/4 + (cos(t)**2 + 1)*cos(3*s/2)/4 + sin(s/2)*sin(s)*cos(t)**2 - sin(t)**2*cos(s/2)*cos(s)/2
X24: raw - decomp = 0

=== Sector-pure combinations ===
For |m|=1 (sin(s/2) mode):
  X13 + X24 = 2*sin(s/2)*B(t)
  Direct: (3*sin(t)**2/2 - 1)*sin(s/2)
  Expected: (3*sin(t)**2 - 2)*sin(s/2)/2
  Match: True

For |m|=1 (cos(s/2) mode):
  X14 - X23 = 2*cos(s/2)*B(t)
  Direct: (3*sin(t)**2/2 - 1)*cos(s/2)
  Match: True

For |m|=3 (sin(3s/2) mode):
  X13 - X24 = 2*sin(3s/2)*A(t)
  Direct: (1 - sin(t)**2/2)*sin(3*s/2)
  Match: True

For |m|=3 (cos(3s/2) mode):
  -(X14 + X23) = 2*cos(3s/2)*A(t)
  Direct: (1 - sin(t)**2/2)*cos(3*s/2)
  Match: True

=== t-profiles phi_K(t) ===
phi_K for |m|=1: (3*sin(t)**2 - 2)/(2*sqrt(4 - 3*sin(t)**2))
phi_K for |m|=3: (cos(t)**2 + 1)/(2*sqrt(3*cos(t)**2 + 1))

phi1(0) = -1/2
phi1(pi/2) = 1/2
phi3(0) = 1/2
phi3(pi/2) = 1/2

Zeros of phi1: B(t) = 0 when sin^2(t) = 2/3
  t* = arcsin(sqrt(2/3)) = asin(sqrt(6)/3)
  Numerical: 0.9553166181
  pi/2 = 1.5707963268
  t* < pi/2: True
  t* > 0: True
  So exactly 1 zero in (0, pi/2) for m=1 sector

Zeros of phi3: A(t) = (1+cos^2(t))/4 >= 1/4 > 0 always
  A(0) = 1/2, A(pi/2) = 1/4
  No zeros in (0, pi/2) for m=3 sector

=== Summary ===
m=1: index = 1 (one zero), nullity = 0 (phi_K(pi/2) != 0)
m=3: index = 0 (no zeros), nullity = 0 (phi_K(pi/2) != 0)
